For the rest of my work, check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/literallymechanical-s-author-page&quot;&gt;LiterallyMechanical&#039;s Author Page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few of my personal favorites:&lt;/p&gt;
