now, it's mostly logos, but I'm sure I'll start adding some actual art over time.</p> <p>As explained on <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/greyve-author-page" target="_blank">my author page</a>, you can use any content I post onto this site with absolutely no limitations. That includes all of my art, which consists of literally anything on this page. Matter of fact, you can even use my logo at the top of the page if you have a particular interest in both the SCP Foundation and a certain progressive rock band.</p> <p>You don't even have to credit me if you don't want to, but that would be nice of you to do.</p> <div id="wiki-tabview-60954b429839dd79199d91313442e733" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Logos</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Icons</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Sketches</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Other</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <h2><span>Logos</span></h2> <p>A set of logos I've made for the various Foundation departments and divisions. Updates pretty frequently, as I like to use these for department or division report backgrounds (as seen <a href="http://scp-wiki.net/scp-5880" target="_blank">here</a>). Feel free to use any of them however you like, and let me know if you need a logo for a department or division that doesn't have one yet!</p> <hr /> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>Icon</th> <th>Inspiration</th> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/e/2PACX-1vRBze5w1FIDAKKtCckoguQKTCKCW_dzk2Y-hDzP3FZY5Mnn_XJP6WKjG8zfLvHLjQ_Gekca0xKiI_HW/pub?w=599&amp;h=600" width="250 px" alt="pub?w=599&amp;h=600" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Administrative Department:</strong> Triangles are a strong shape. Also, top-down management.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/e/2PACX-1vSEMiHQ6WYZDDQSjsg303342rDKyBVXvnsTy8tMu9rgRrQuqtYKGd4zGD6Gdsm0CXK2g_p8bpFi5J-r/pub?w=599&amp;h=600" width="250 px" alt="pub?w=599&amp;h=600" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Occult Studies Division:</strong> Ouroboros, an ancient symbol associated with magic.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/e/2PACX-1vRcV3QE4ACx_5oCYPtdlM-qYwMCtzWBc0i_hMajioE6e66sxyl0rzLF4imG-YK2QdPT69bWY2UgCaId/pub?w=599&amp;h=600" width="250 px" alt="pub?w=599&amp;h=600" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>IT Department:</strong> Modified USB to have three arrows, like the Foundation.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/e/2PACX-1vRO-PpC3s7nCBJ6FbvbJJSgNFInVZSR4GjctJGWyyzYp-Hx-OBYdsCKSWDhMaDOtsX93087jwXMi9Nd/pub?w=599&amp;h=600" width="250 px" alt="pub?w=599&amp;h=600" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Memetics and Infohazards Division:</strong> Negative space. Memes exist <em>inside</em> of us, so the arrow symbolizes entering our own consciousness.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/e/2PACX-1vTKdNHF4047T3200eXUbGsX83rIzt0GEnSaan7Pqg1_Z7vHCNxNEn6okX1oJ83uzemNZXu22W6CIA58/pub?w=599&amp;h=600" width="250 px" alt="pub?w=599&amp;h=600" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Medical Department:</strong> The Rod of Asclepius, symbolic of the Greek god of healing. Two snakes is the Caduceus, which actually has nothing to do with medicine.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/e/2PACX-1vSf-HTSZyhj8I09TjLe7SnrREUU2VgEmfc7XV9NlmP2gaTuEfT_n2JfO0W9vneBNcYFL5EcJkTz6dVN/pub?w=599&amp;h=600" width="250 px" alt="pub?w=599&amp;h=600" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>O5 Command:</strong> A scaled-up version of the Administrative Department logo, with three arrowheads added inside. Also, the negative space resembles a V, the Roman numeral for five.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/e/2PACX-1vTkOupqpVLeYOYtj2uKq9xcE-SGgEBuvxTZMLGArXqYKrlfkkCBO-qMw4BokATjxJEAKJNBdFT9MiLt/pub?w=599&amp;h=600" width="250 px" alt="pub?w=599&amp;h=600" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Ethics Committee:</strong> A scale, the universal symbol for justice, modified to resemble three arrows pointing heavenward, since their duty is above humanity.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/e/2PACX-1vSmPr9Ff3WwgZNcNhueWvdMY9ni19Zt76YORYh6r2HkpZGEniWUw1QmMuvccPGp4q6xu1nbPjwTYbmm/pub?w=599&amp;h=600" width="250 px" alt="pub?w=599&amp;h=600" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Decommissioning Department:</strong> For <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606206239" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span>, even though he didn't ask. Just a simple symbol universally recognized as meaning no.</td> </tr> </table> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <h2><span>Icons</span></h2> <p>Icons for <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/anomaly-classification-system-guide" target="_blank">ACS</a>. For more custom icons, check out <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/dr-moned-s-icons-and-art" target="_blank">Dr Moned's art page</a>!</p> <hr /> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>Logo</th> <th>Inspiration</th> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/e/2PACX-1vT9LHefvI_BD_Q4ShhBbOUEV_6SEAeUDFG9WL_ZLd3Nm494EJR7sbm1vZCl3S2heIxAMpX_CVVgkhj3/pub?w=360&amp;h=360" width="250 px" alt="pub?w=360&amp;h=360" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Zurvan:</strong> As seen in <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5103" target="_blank">SCP-5103</a>, by yours truly. Based on the narrative, as well as the traditional depiction of the Zoroastrian god Zurvan.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/greyve-art-page/Decommissioned.png" width="250 px" alt="Decommissioned.png" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Decommissioned:</strong> Revived by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606206239" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span>. Why did I make my own when he already has one? I like making things complicated for myself.</td> </tr> </table> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <h2><span>Sketches</span></h2> <p>Sketches of skips, or whatever else, I guess. Feel free to commission a sketch from me for absolutely no cost, with no satisfaction guarantee!</p> <hr /> <h3><span>My Stuff</span></h3> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Open</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲&nbsp;Now&nbsp;with&nbsp;100%&nbsp;less&nbsp;cognitohazards!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/greyve-art-page/actually4937.jpg" alt="actually4937.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Open</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▲&nbsp;More&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;mural&nbsp;but&nbsp;whatever.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/greyve-art-page/5117.jpg" alt="5117.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <h2><span>Other</span></h2> <p>Other stuff that I've done. May or may not be related to SCP, but it exists, so&#8230;yeah.</p> <hr /> <h3><span><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-achievement-badges" target="_blank">SCP Achievment Badges</a></span></h3> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td><img src="https://piskel-imgstore-b.appspot.com/img/f82c6417-b71c-11ea-992b-1b36457c3014.gif" width="50 px" alt="f82c6417-b71c-11ea-992b-1b36457c3014.gif" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Bard:</strong>Write 10 tales at &gt; +30 each</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://piskel-imgstore-b.appspot.com/img/d0c9bb54-b71b-11ea-b347-1b36457c3014.gif" width="50 px" alt="d0c9bb54-b71b-11ea-b347-1b36457c3014.gif" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Canonball:</strong> Write at least 3 tales set in an official canons &gt; +50 each</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://piskel-imgstore-b.appspot.com/img/7cbcd000-b71b-11ea-a5d7-1b36457c3014.gif" width="50 px" alt="7cbcd000-b71b-11ea-a5d7-1b36457c3014.gif" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Hat Trick:</strong> Win as an individual or as part of a winning team in 3 SCP wiki contests</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://piskel-imgstore-b.appspot.com/img/fd8b2694-b71b-11ea-b3a4-1b36457c3014.gif" width="50 px" alt="fd8b2694-b71b-11ea-b3a4-1b36457c3014.gif" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Iconic:</strong> Write a page at &gt; +600</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://piskel-imgstore-b.appspot.com/img/b7f173ba-b71e-11ea-b9a0-1b36457c3014.gif" width="50 px" alt="b7f173ba-b71e-11ea-b9a0-1b36457c3014.gif" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Level Up!:</strong> Be a member of the SCP Wiki for one calendar year</td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="https://piskel-imgstore-b.appspot.com/img/e71956c0-b71c-11ea-b291-1b36457c3014.gif" width="50 px" alt="e71956c0-b71c-11ea-b291-1b36457c3014.gif" class="image" /></td> <td><strong>Writerbot:</strong> Write 50 pages at &gt; +50 each</td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> </div> <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div c