&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-756588-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Which Smith &lt;em&gt;really&lt;/em&gt; didn&#039;t like. 109 just didn&#039;t have the same ring to it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-756588-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Icky and Manny banned alcoholic drinks after the whole Bubblegum fiasco. He still had the nightmares.&lt;/div&gt;
