&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Written as part of the Doomcon contest (for team &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/k-o-failure-scenario-hub&quot;&gt;JAWESOME&lt;/a&gt;, which posited a doomsday event resulting from the SPC!) along with &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1553042&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606206240&quot; alt=&quot;PeppersGhost&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1553042)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost&quot;  &gt;PeppersGhost&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Not gonna lie, Peppersghost did the heavy lifting here; mostly I got this collab on account of making a lot of last minute edits (we posted it literally a minute before the deadline, with him writing out the journal and me coming up right behind him and rewriting it).&lt;/p&gt;
