&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I wanted to write something in the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/resurrection&quot;&gt;Resurrection&lt;/a&gt; canon; this is what ended up coming out. I&#039;m unreasonably proud of the fact that I found a way to work &#039;sheep-fucker&#039; into &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-076&quot;&gt;SCP-076&lt;/a&gt;&#039;s backstory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/in-the-garden&quot;&gt;In the Garden&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
 &lt;em&gt;Right away, Rebecca could tell that the wand was high-end&amp;#8230; Probably a semi-automagic.&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt; ►&amp;nbsp;Commentary&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
