&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt; ▼&amp;nbsp;Close&amp;nbsp;File&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I have no idea where this is supposed to go. I just really liked the idea of a universe where the Foundation is &#039;reversed&#039;; containing science rather than &#039;miracles&#039;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
