&lt;p&gt;The third (and final) part of the Hartliss series. I&#039;m pretty happy with this, even though it took forever to produce. Needless author head-cannoning: Reinhardt is responsible for Cragstaff Sanitarium (&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3054&quot;&gt;SCP-3054&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
