&lt;div class=&quot;bibitem&quot; id=&quot;bibitem-680675-2&quot;&gt;2. Brumell, J (1978). &amp;quot;A History of the Fourth Occult War&amp;quot;; &lt;em&gt;Prometheus Publications&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bibitem&quot; id=&quot;bibitem-680675-3&quot;&gt;3. Andrews, K (1972). &amp;quot;The Limits of Practicality: the current state of Inter-Dimensional Travel and Storage&amp;quot;; &lt;em&gt;Prometheus Laboratories Journal&lt;/em&gt; Vol 45(4); pp 12-35.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bibitem&quot; id=&quot;bibitem-680675-4&quot;&gt;4. Also referred to as &amp;quot;Type Greens&amp;quot;. See Prof. ████████████ (1979) &amp;quot;Applied Thaumatology (Lecture Transcript)&amp;quot;; &lt;em&gt;GOC-Prometheus Cooperative Publications&lt;/em&gt;; Vol 2(1); pp 6-14.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bibitem&quot; id=&quot;bibitem-680675-5&quot;&gt;5. Tse, A (1981). &amp;quot;Methods of Change to Baseline Universal Laws&amp;quot;; &lt;em&gt;PL Journal of Para-biology&lt;/em&gt;; Vol 42(6); pp 84-116.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bibitem&quot; id=&quot;bibitem-680675-6&quot;&gt;6. Caldmann, J &amp;amp; Rzewski, C (1982). &amp;quot;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/and-this-one-explains-humes&quot;&gt;Humes: A Quantitative Study of the Fundamental Basis of Reality&lt;/a&gt;&amp;quot; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/an-faq-part-two-or-your-hume-questions-answered&quot;&gt;responses to questions on that article&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;Foundation&lt;/em&gt; (Edited excerpts supplied under Foundation-PL information exchange agreement).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bibitem&quot; id=&quot;bibitem-680675-7&quot;&gt;7. Heinemann, O (1979). &amp;quot;What Did the Ancient Turks Ever Do For Us?&amp;quot;; &lt;em&gt;Historia Prometheo&lt;/em&gt;; Vol 23(2); pp 8-13 at Figure 7.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

