&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;THE FOLLOWING FILE IS PROTECTED BY A PROMETHEUS LABS GARDEN-CHAUCER MEMETIC KILL HAZARD&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-241420-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sup&gt;,&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-241420-3&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sup&gt;,&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-241420-4&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;THOSE LACKING PROPER CLEARANCE WILL BE TERMINATED UPON UNAUTHORIZED VIEWING OF THIS FILE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;YOU HAVE BEEN WARNED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
