&lt;div class=&quot;bibitem&quot; id=&quot;bibitem-559900-2&quot;&gt;2. Canton, P. (2013). Meta Articles and What They Mean for the SCP Foundation. &lt;em&gt;Journal of Metaphysics&lt;/em&gt;, 90-101.&lt;/div&gt;
