&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;hey is it ok if i put a footnote here? -Anonymous&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;I think we actually got it to work! Simmons had a fatal seizure at his desk after I told him this was today&#039;s itinerary. -Marcus&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;The image is supposed to give you a heart attack. -Gary&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;How the hell is an image supposed to stop your heart? -Craig&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;No, God dammit! You&#039;re supposed to add like a shitload of new lines so you can&#039;t die before confirming you actually WANT to see the page. -Tony&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;Is the image supposed to look all corrupted like that? God, that color is giving me a headache. -Terrence&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;You don&#039;t think the Foundation will be mad that we stole their SCP-001 message te&lt;/em&gt; (the footnote was incomplete upon discovery, but published regardless.)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;Ok, who the hell doesn&#039;t know how to make collapsibles? -Carter&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. Internet Relay Chat, used for text communication.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. SCP Declassified, a group that aims to explain SCPs that are deemed confusing, or that have hidden meanings to others who are unable to understand these.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. An online chat program, similar to IRC, that supports voice and video communication.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-12&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;. It should be noted that his experience and skill with CSS are rudimentary.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-13&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;13&lt;/a&gt;. Author pages can be in character or out of character within the SCP universe; this choice is up to the author.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-241420-14&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;14&lt;/a&gt;. Who cares? They&#039;re all special in their own ways :^)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

